["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">寧</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>宁可；宁愿；平静；安宁；安静</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ネイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">むし.ろ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">丁寧</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ていねい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">礼貌；仔细</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">寧ろ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">むしろ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">宁可；与其说；倒不如；反而</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">循</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>循环；遵循</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジュン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">循環</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅんかん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">循环；轮转；周转；循环往复</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">忍</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>忍耐；隐藏；偷偷做；忍受；潜伏</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ニン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しの.ぶ・しの.ばせる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">怠</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>懒惰；怠慢；疏忽</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">タイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おこた.る・なま.ける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">怠ける</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なまける</span><span class=\"k-wz\">偷懒；怠惰；懈怠；怠慢（工作等）；疏忽；旷课</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">怠る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おこたる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">怠慢；疏忽；懈怠；不做；未完成；避免；逃避；不留心；（疾病）好转；康复；改善</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">怠慢</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たいまん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">怠慢；疏忽；粗心大意；拖延</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">如</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>像似；如同；例如；好像；相等</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジョ・ニョ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ごと.し</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">突如</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とつじょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">突然；猝然；意外地</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">如何に</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いかに</span><span class=\"k-wz\">怎样；如何；以什么方式；多少；到什么程度；如何（程度）；不论多么；无论怎样；任凭如何；嘿；喂</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">如何にも</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いかにも</span><span class=\"k-wz\">确实；真的；的确；就像（……一样）；非常；极其；十分；完全；绝对；当然；确实如此</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">寮</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>宿舍；旅馆；别墅；茶室</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">寮</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">宿舍；宿泊所；（律令制下）省以下的政府部门；茶室；别墅；别院</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">祐</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>帮助；援助</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ユウ・ウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たす.ける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">鵬</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>大鹏</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ホウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おおとり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">鉛</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>铅</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">エン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">なまり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">鉛筆</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えんぴつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">铅笔</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">鉛</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なまり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">铅</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">珠</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>珍珠；宝石；珠宝</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シュ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たま</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">真珠</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんじゅ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">珍珠</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">凝</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>凝固；冻结；僵硬；专注；凝滞</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ギョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">こ.る・こ.らす・こご.らす・こご.らせる・こご.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">凝る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こごる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">凝结；胶化；冻结</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">凝らす</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こごらす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">冻结；凝固；集中注意力；专心致志；沉思；冥想</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">苗</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>幼苗；秧苗；嫩芽</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ビョウ・ミョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">なえ・なわ-</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">苗</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なえ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">苗；幼苗；秧苗；水稻秧苗</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">獣</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>野兽；畜生</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">けもの・けだもの</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">獣</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けだもの</span><span class=\"k-wz\">野兽；禽兽；动物；具有人类特征的动物</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">怪獣</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいじゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">怪兽；怪物</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">哀</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>悲哀；怜悯；悲伤；同情；哀愁</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">アイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あわ.れ・あわ.れむ・かな.しい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">哀れ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あわれ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">怜悯；悲伤；悲痛；不幸；同情；哀愁；可怜的；令人同情的；悲惨的；凄惨的；哎呀；唉</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">跳</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>跳跃；弹跳；溅起；蹦跳；翘起</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">は.ねる・と.ぶ・-と.び</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">跳ぶ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とぶ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">飞；翱翔；跳跃；跳起；弹起；蹦跳；飞溅；散落；溅射；飞出；匆忙；急速；逃离；逃脱；逃走；消失；消散；褪去；稀疏；断裂；脱落；掉落；烧断；发出；流传；扩散；飞来；击来；缺失；遗漏；跳过；中断</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">跳ねる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はねる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">跳跃；跳起；蹦跳；弹起；跳动；解散；结束；撞击；碰撞（如汽车撞到某物或某人）；（围棋）扳</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">匠</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>工匠；木匠；手艺人</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たくみ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">垂</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>下垂；悬挂；滴落；垂落；耷拉</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">スイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">た.れる・た.らす・た.れ・-た.れ・なんなんと.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">垂直</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すいちょく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">竖直；垂直；垂直；成直角</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">垂れる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たれる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">悬挂；下垂；摇晃；拉低；传授；授予；赐予；赏赐；滴落；渗出；涓流；遗留；留下；说；讲述；排泄；放屁</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">蛇</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>蛇；蛇（爬行动物）；酒量大的人</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジャ・ダ・イ・ヤ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">へび</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">蛇口</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゃぐち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">水龙头；水嘴</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">澄</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>澄清；清澈；沉淀；澄清（液体）；严肃</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">す.む・す.ます・-す.ます</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">澄む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（水、空气等）变清澈；变透明；（声音等）清脆响亮；清澈悦耳；变得平静；变得宁静；消除烦恼；发清音；读作清音</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">澄ます</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すます</span><span class=\"k-wz\">澄清；使清澈；镇定自若；不动声色；假装漠不关心；装作文静；装作端庄；摆架子；竖起耳朵；仔细倾听</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">縫</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>缝；缝合；刺绣</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ホウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ぬ.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">裁縫</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さいほう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">缝纫；针线活</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">縫う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぬう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">缝；缝纫；缝制；穿行；迂回前进</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">僧</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>僧侣；和尚</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">僧</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">僧；僧侣；和尚；僧伽；佛教僧团</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">眺</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>凝视；注视；眺望；观看；细看</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">なが.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">眺め</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ながめ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">景色；风景；景观；远景</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">眺める</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ながめる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">看；凝视；注视；盯着；俯瞰；眺望；欣赏（如风景）；旁观；袖手旁观；观察</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">唐</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>唐朝；中国；外国</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">から</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">亘</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>跨越；延伸；范围</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ・カン・セン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">わた.る・もと.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">呉</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>给予；为对方做（某事）；吴（古代中国诸侯国名）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゴ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">く.れる・くれ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">凡</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a clas